WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.260
The Emperor has long loomed over the Star
Wars saga.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.290
Sometimes, he’s manipulated events from
the shadows.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:10.610
Other times, he’s stepped onto the screen
and shocked audiences with his crazy powers.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.820
From his days as an apprentice to his appearance
in Episode IX, here’s the entire Emperor

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.520
Palpatine story.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.130
Sheev Palpatine, the man who would become
a Sith Lord and the galactic emperor, was

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.060
born on the planet Naboo.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.650
According to the novel Darth Plagueis, young
Palpatine first discovered the temptation

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.860
of the Dark Side of the Force while collecting
Sith artifacts.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.660
As a young man he met Plagueis.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.070
The encounter led Palpatine to kill his entire
family and dedicate himself to becoming Darth

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.050
Plagueis' Sith apprentice.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.190
As a result, Plagueis gave him the name of
Darth Sidious.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:44.489
Like Plagueis before him, Sidious carefully
maintained his non-Sith identity as Sheev

00:00:44.489 --> 00:00:47.789
Palpatine, and he became active in politics
on Naboo.

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:52.300
He rose in rank to become a senator after
secretly arranging the assassination of his

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.879
predecessor, representing Naboo in the Galactic
Senate.

00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:59.160
He remained in that position for years, methodically
working to accumulate more power, gaining

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.149
strength both politically and in the Dark
Side.

00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:06.440
While Palpatine gained popularity in the Senate,
Darth Sidious formed alliances in the darker

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.250
corners of the galaxy.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.790
Appearing as a mysterious cloaked figure who
primarily communicated via hologram, he contacted

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.890
and manipulated groups who were dissatisfied
with the Republic, such as the Neimoidians

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.500
and their Trade Federation.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:22.140
When it was finally time to make his bid to
become chancellor of the Republic, he encouraged

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:26.399
the Neimoidians to blockade Naboo, creating
a crisis that would provide him with a political

00:01:26.399 --> 00:01:27.399
opportunity.

00:01:27.399 --> 00:01:31.270
During this same period, Palpatine took custody
of a young Zabrak and had him raised in the

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.700
ways of the Dark Side.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.039
The Zabrak became Sidious' first Sith apprentice,
Darth Maul.

00:01:37.039 --> 00:01:40.990
Since nobody knew that he was the one behind
the Trade Federation's blockade of Naboo,

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:44.700
Palpatine was able to exploit the incident
to consolidate his political power.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.979
When Chancellor Valorum failed to take strong
action to defend Naboo, Palpatine encouraged

00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:53.680
Naboo's Queen Amidala to call for a vote of
no confidence in Valorum, which in turn led

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.149
to a new election.

00:01:55.149 --> 00:01:58.830
Being the senator from the planet that was
in crisis, Palpatine was perfectly positioned

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.680
to win the election and become the new supreme
chancellor of the Republic.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.759
Taking the top office in the galaxy was a
huge step in Palpatine's rise, but it would

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:11.520
still take years of simultaneously consolidating
his political power as chancellor while also

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:16.640
stoking the galaxy's conflicts as Darth Sidious
before he would be able to gain absolute power.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:21.200
He would also need a new Sith apprentice,
as Darth Maul was defeated and seemingly killed

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.750
by Obi-Wan Kenobi as the Naboo crisis was
drawing to a close.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:30.099
After the defeat of Darth Maul, Palpatine's
new Sith apprentice was the elderly aristocrat

00:02:30.099 --> 00:02:34.590
Count Dooku, who acted as his proxy in leading
a separatist movement of multiple systems

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.980
that were dissatisfied with the Republic.

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:40.760
When the Separatists were found to be building
a vast droid army, Chancellor Palpatine was

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.630
granted special powers to deal with the threat.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:48.360
As it turns out, using other proxies, he'd
already commissioned an army of clone troopers,

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.750
and his new powers enabled him to command
that army to go to war against the Separatists.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:56.780
Not only was Palpatine's power increased,
but the Republic ended a long period of peace

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:02.080
to become a dominant military power in the
galaxy, a big step closer to becoming an empire.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.660
Outwardly, the chancellor pretended to be
reluctant to take on the burden of greater

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.670
power and lead the Republic into war, but
of course, it was all part of the long game

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.659
he'd been playing since the beginning.

00:03:11.659 --> 00:03:16.349
Three years later, Chancellor Palpatine arranged
his own capture by Count Dooku's Separatist

00:03:16.349 --> 00:03:17.349
forces.

00:03:17.349 --> 00:03:20.790
He was rescued, as he knew he would be, by
Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.660
"I sense a trap.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.560
Next move?

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:25.560
Spring the trap."

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:30.480
At Palpatine's urging, Anakin killed an already-defeated
and literally disarmed Dooku.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.601
From then on, Palpatine began actively working
to seduce Anakin to the Dark Side of the Force

00:03:34.601 --> 00:03:38.590
and make the powerful young Jedi into a new
Sith apprentice.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:42.370
Anakin was concerned for the health of his
pregnant wife, Padmé, and Palpatine planted

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:46.730
the idea in Anakin's head that becoming powerful
in the Dark Side was the key to ensuring that

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.430
she survived the pregnancy.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:52.540
Ultimately, of course, Palpatine didn't care
about Padmé at all, and it was Anakin's turn

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.430
to the Dark Side that led to her death.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:59.319
In his new Sith persona as Darth Vader, Anakin
Skywalker would become the most powerful ally

00:03:59.319 --> 00:04:04.900
Palpatine had ever had and a key part of his
plan to eliminate the Jedi and rule the galaxy.

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:09.569
When the Jedi finally realized that Palpatine
was a Sith Lord, it was far too late.

00:04:09.569 --> 00:04:13.840
A vicious battle with Jedi Master Mace Windu
brought about a fearsome change to Palpatine's

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.450
physical appearance.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:19.160
While there has been much speculation, it's
unclear whether Palpatine was disfigured by

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:23.050
Force lightning, as he claimed, or whether
he was revealing what had already been his

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.070
true appearance.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:29.060
In any case, the evil within him came to the
surface, and his face got all gross and pasty.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:33.340
Ironically, his disfigurement enabled him
to turn the Senate against the Jedi who'd

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:34.340
attacked him.

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:38.220
He took the opportunity to seize the power
he'd worked so long to bring within his grasp

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.780
and declared himself emperor of the galaxy.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.470
Although the Galactic Senate would remain
in place for years to come, the Republic had

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.740
become the Empire, and with the Jedi eliminated
by the clone troopers, there was nobody left

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.410
to challenge Palpatine's power.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:55.800
Almost 20 years later, Emperor Palpatine dissolved
the Galactic Senate permanently, because the

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:59.120
completion of the Death Star enabled him to
rule through fear.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:03.030
Commanded by one of the Emperor's most trusted
and ruthless operatives, Grand Moff Tarkin,

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.300
the Death Star was a mobile space station
with the power to destroy entire planets.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.840
As a demonstration of its power, Tarkin obliterated
the planet Alderaan, home to key members of

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.380
the Rebel Alliance who were working against
the Empire.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:19.330
Leia Organa, adopted princess of Alderaan
and secretly the daughter of Anakin Skywalker,

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:22.819
was forced to watch the destruction of her
planet from the deck of the Death Star, where

00:05:22.819 --> 00:05:25.090
she was being held prisoner at the time.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:28.870
As these events unfolded Emperor Palpatine
remained unseen in the background, leaving

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:32.360
Tarkin and Darth Vader to do his dirty work
aboard the Death Star.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.930
"I recognized your foul stench when I was
brought on board."

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.960
"Charming, to the last."

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:43.940
This turned to be particularly fortunate for
him because he was nowhere near the Death

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.810
Star when Luke Skywalker managed to blow it
up on behalf of the Rebel Alliance.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.500
Darth Vader was able to escape the destruction,
but Tarkin and the other military leaders

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.720
on board all died.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:57.520
Following the destruction of the Death Star,
Emperor Palpatine and Darth Vader both learned

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:01.190
the identity of Luke Skywalker, and they became
determined to find him.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.919
As Vader searched for Luke and the Rebels,
Palpatine remained in the imperial capital

00:06:04.919 --> 00:06:08.660
of Coruscant and communicated with Vader via
hologram.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.600
Palpatine suspected that Vader wanted to turn
his son to the Dark Side and overthrow Palpatine

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.979
with his help.

00:06:13.979 --> 00:06:17.400
Killing your master after you've found your
apprentice was Sith tradition, after all,

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.419
and it was exactly what Palpatine had done
to his own master.

00:06:20.419 --> 00:06:23.800
For his part, Palpatine hoped that either
Luke would kill his father and then replace

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.940
him as the Emperor's apprentice, or that Luke
would die, thus eliminating the threat and

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.830
maintaining the status quo.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:34.240
Eventually, Vader would confront Luke on Bespin,
but he failed to convert, capture, or kill

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.240
him.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:38.650
He did however reveal himself as Luke's father,
ensuring that Luke would eventually seek out

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:42.509
Vader by choice, which could only put him
in the path of the Emperor.

00:06:42.509 --> 00:06:46.199
With construction underway on the second Death
Star, Emperor Palpatine decided to take a

00:06:46.199 --> 00:06:48.960
more active hand in the Galactic Civil War.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:52.580
Arriving on the new Death Star to oversee
its completion himself, the Emperor carefully

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.000
laid a trap for the Rebel Alliance.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:58.070
He knew they were planning to attack the Death
Star before it was finished, so he made sure

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:01.759
that when the Rebels arrived, the half-built
space station's weapon systems would be fully

00:07:01.759 --> 00:07:07.610
operational.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:11.120
What enabled the Rebels to ultimately win
the day was the efforts of a Rebel team on

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.990
the surface of the forest moon of Endor, where
the new Death Star was in orbit during its

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:15.990
construction.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.860
Led by Han and Leia, these Rebels were eventually
able to shut down the shield generator that

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:23.940
protected the incomplete Death Star, enabling
Rebel ships to destroy it.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.729
Ironically, Darth Vader had allowed the ship
holding the Rebel party to approach Endor,

00:07:27.729 --> 00:07:30.540
even though he sensed Luke Skywalker's presence
among them.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:34.419
That was the first of Vader's betrayals at
Endor that led to the Emperor's downfall,

00:07:34.419 --> 00:07:37.410
but it was far from the last.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:41.580
As the Emperor had predicted, Luke Skywalker
soon sought out Darth Vader on Endor.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:45.879
The young Jedi surrendered, and Vader brought
him before Palpatine on the new Death Star.

00:07:45.879 --> 00:07:49.669
The Emperor could sense that the emotional
Luke was veering closer to the Dark Side,

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:53.520
and he and Vader encouraged Luke to give himself
over to his emotional turmoil.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:57.610
Palpatine seemed ready to die if it would
cement Luke's turn to the Dark Side, but he

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:01.699
was even more enthusiastic about the possibility
of Luke killing his father and taking Vader's

00:08:01.699 --> 00:08:04.190
place by the Emperor's side.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:07.409
Ultimately Luke resisted the Dark Side, casting
his weapon away.

00:08:07.409 --> 00:08:11.580
At that point, Palpatine revealed that, like
the armed and operational Death Star, he wasn't

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.750
as weak and helpless as he seemed.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:17.889
The Emperor blasted the young Skywalker with
Force lightning from his fingertips, preparing

00:08:17.889 --> 00:08:21.540
to kill him even as the Death Star's weapons
killed Luke's allies.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:25.330
At the last moment, however, Darth Vader was
unable to stand by and watch as the man who'd

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:29.349
ruined his life tried to murder his son as
well, and Vader grabbed Palpatine and hurled

00:08:29.349 --> 00:08:33.720
him down a seemingly bottomless shaft within
the Death Star, killing the Emperor.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:37.720
Darth Vader died immediately afterwards, and
Luke managed to escape just as his allies

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:42.120
finally destroyed the second Death Star, which
was a decisive victory against the Empire.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:47.270
It's debatable, in the end, whether Palpatine
died on the Death Star or not, but if he did

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:49.150
he managed to come back pretty quickly.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:52.310
He never exactly says how, but cloning seems
to be involved.

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:56.330
He hid for decades on the planet Exegol in
the Unknown Regions.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:09:00.270
He created the figure of Snoke, the original
Supreme Leader of the First Order, to be his

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.920
puppet until it was time for the rebirth of
the Empire as the Final Order.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:08.280
He also built an entire Sith empire on that
hidden planet, complete with a vast fleet

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:12.130
of Star Destroyers that would be able to crush
the Resistance and once again establish his

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.890
dominance over the Galaxy.

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:18.100
When he eventually revealed himself, he recruited
Supreme Leader Kylo Ren, who had already killed

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.130
Snoke and taken over the First Order.

00:09:20.130 --> 00:09:24.390
Palpatine promised Ren even greater power
if Ren would fulfill his wishes, and for a

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.230
time Kylo seemed to agree.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.670
Somewhere along the line, ol' pasty Palp had
himself a kid, and eventually his greatest

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.070
concern became his granddaughter, Rey.

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:37.640
He'd been searching for her since she was
born, but she was a grown woman before she

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:41.910
learned about her connection to him and journeyed
to Exegol to destroy her grandfather and end

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.830
his threat to the galaxy.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:47.360
Then she learned that his death at her hands
was part of Palpatine's plan.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:51.000
If she killed him in anger, she would turn
to the dark side, take the spirits of him

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.140
and the other Sith within her, and become
the new Empress.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:57.880
When Kylo Ren, having turned away from the
dark side, arrived to help Rey, Palpatine

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.140
drew on both of their life forces to restore
himself, regaining mobility and his trademark

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.140
yellow eyes.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:07.780
He used his vast power to shoot the Resistance
fleet out of the sky with those fancy force

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:12.340
fingers, until a weakened Rey managed to redirect
the lighting back onto him, basically making

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.070
Palpatine kill himself.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.090
As for Emperor Palpatine, is he dead for real
now?

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:21.450
The Skywalker saga is supposed to be over,
so it's nice to believe he is.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:25.090
But he might have just retreated to another
planet and another body, waiting for a future

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.310
decade to try it all again.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.920
His ambition, after all, is stronger than
death.

